hadiths[16]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1106","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"1107","'Alqama said"
"1108","Anas said"
"1109","'Abdullah ibn 'Umar said that the Messenger of Allah"
"1110","Ibn 'Abbas said"
"1111","Usama ibn Zayd related that one day the Prophet"
"1112","'Abdullah ibn 'Abbas related that Abu Sufyan ibn Harb sent him\nto Heraclius"
"1113","Jabir said"
"1114","See 1103."
"1115","'Uqba ibn 'Amir al-Juhani passed by a man who looked like a Muslim\nwho greeted him. 'Uqba answered him"
"1116","Ibn 'Abbas said"
"1117","Abu Musa said"
"1118","'Abdu'r-Rahman said"
"1119","'A'isha reported that the Prophet"
"1120","Ibn 'Abbas said"
"1121","'A'isha bint Talha said"
